1 0 0 1 54 730 Tm
([Masked Language Modeling & Next Sentence Prediction]) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 702 Tm
(3.1 Pre-training BERT: Building on the Transformer encoder architecture proposed by) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 687 Tm
(Vaswani et al. \(2017\), we pre-train BERT using two unsupervised tasks: Masked) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 672 Tm
(Language Modeling \(MLM\) and Next Sentence Prediction \(NSP\). In Masked LM, we) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 657 Tm
(randomly mask 15% of all WordPiece tokens in each sequence and predict the masked) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 642 Tm
(tokens.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 609 Tm
(For the 15% of tokens selected for masking, we replace the token with the [MASK]) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 594 Tm
(token 80% of the time, a random token 10% of the time, and the unchanged token 10%) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 579 Tm
(of the time. Next Sentence Prediction trains a binary classifier to determine) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 564 Tm
(whether sentence B actually follows sentence A in the pre-training corpus.) Tj
ET
endstream
